Template: rustyrig-server/admin-password
Type: password
Default:
Description: Password for the RustyRig admin account:
 Choose the password used to log in as the RustyRig admin user.  This is
 required when creating a new server database.  An existing database is not
 changed during upgrades.

Template: rustyrig-server/enable-guest
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Enable the shared guest account?
 Guests log in with username "guest" and password "guest". The shipped guest
 permissions allow chat, radio control and transmission, subject to server
 restrictions and quotas. Enable this only if you want shared guest access
 to your LAN/VPN station.
 .
 The account is disabled by default. This choice applies only when creating
 a new server database; existing accounts are preserved during upgrades.
